{"id":"9e8c89671eb83702","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-finite-model.md","title":"Finite Model","display":"df-finite-model — Finite Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-finite-model","aliases":["93-df-finite-model"],"display":"df-finite-model — Finite Model","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","[[93-df-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-finite-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-finite-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-model — Finite Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" href=\"?note=2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" title=\"93-df-model\">93-df-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> is a first-order structure with carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-theory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\\)</span> is the model predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" href=\"?note=2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" title=\"93-df-model\">93-df-model</a> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> is the finite-set predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinMod}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinMod}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinMod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(|\\mathfrak A|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinMod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Finiteness is applied to the model's bound carrier projection; the former free <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> could denote a different set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"2e6273b8ebf2e31a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"2e6273b8ebf2e31a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}$ is the model predicate of [[93-df-model]] and $\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}$ is the finite-set predicate of [[93-df-set-theoretic-background]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}$ is the model predicate of [[93-df-model]] and $\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}$ is the finite-set predicate of [[93-df-set-theoretic-background]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinMod}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinMod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(|\\mathfrak A|)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":951,"backlinks":[{"id":"0838691d607f25ab","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2401933431e79141","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["e30eac382dc7d1a7","2e6273b8ebf2e31a"]}